// ============================================================================
// RS_VR_Weapons -- VANILLA+'S FLOOR PICKUPS (the owner, 09-15: "take them from RS Main"; "the same size as vanilla
// doom pickup sprites"). RS_Main's pickup art (graphics/vp_pickups, unchanged), CROPPED to its visible pixels and
// SCALED to fit the vanilla Doom pickup sprite of its kind of gun, OFFSET bottom-centre so it stands on the floor.
// WM_PairPickup (weaponset.zs PickupLook) draws these for a Vanilla+ viewer; the guns RS_Main has no pickup art for
// wear Doom's own nearest sprite there. Written by the weapons lane's vp_pickup_sizes.py.
// ============================================================================

// rs_gh_weapon/gh_pumpshotgun/HBSGA0.png: visible 64 x 16 of 69 x 20; as SHOTA0 (63 x 12) -> 48.0 x 12.0
Sprite "VPSGA0", 64, 16
{
	XScale 1.3333
	YScale 1.3333
	Offset 32, 16
	Patch "graphics/vp_pickups/HBSGA0.png", -3, -4
}

